---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="How It Works"
  description="Learn about ebin's 4-stage responsible e-waste recycling workflow in Bengaluru. Direct personal coordination, certified recycling, zero live tracking gimmicks."
>
  
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eco-400 bg-charcoal-800 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-charcoal-700">
        Our Process
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
        Simple, personal, and 100% accountable.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-charcoal-300 leading-relaxed">
        From your drawer in Bengaluru to certified recycling facilities. Here is exactly what happens from the moment you submit a pickup request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Notice on Live Tracking -->
  <section class="bg-charcoal-800 border-b border-charcoal-700 py-3.5 text-center text-xs text-charcoal-300 px-4">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-eco-400"></span>
      <span><strong>Direct Human Coordination:</strong> We do not use live GPS tracking or complex apps. Our local dispatch coordinator updates you personally by phone or WhatsApp.</span>
    </span>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Detailed Stages -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
      
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 font-black text-2xl border border-eco-200">
            01
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal-400 mt-3">Stage One</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mt-1">Request Received</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9 bg-charcoal-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-charcoal-100 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Everything starts when you submit your pickup request through our website. You provide your location in Bengaluru, your general list of electronic items (laptops, phones, old TVs, batteries, cables), and your preferred day and time.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ No App Downloads</span>
              Fill out a clean web form on mobile or desktop in under 60 seconds.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Instant Logging</span>
              Your details are routed immediately to our Bengaluru dispatch queue.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 font-black text-2xl border border-eco-200">
            02
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal-400 mt-3">Stage Two</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mt-1">Confirmed by Call or Message</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9 bg-charcoal-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-charcoal-100 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Within 24 hours of booking, our Bengaluru operations manager personally calls or messages you over WhatsApp. We verify the items, check apartment gate permissions if needed, and confirm an exact 2-hour window.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Real Human Support</span>
              Direct phone or WhatsApp communication — no automated bots or lost tickets.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Rescheduling Flexibility</span>
              Easily adjust your pickup timing if your schedule changes.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 3 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 font-black text-2xl border border-eco-200">
            03
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal-400 mt-3">Stage Three</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mt-1">Doorstep Pickup Done</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9 bg-charcoal-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-charcoal-100 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Our vetted executive arrives at your doorstep wearing identification. Devices are cataloged and weighed or inspected. If your devices qualify for monetary indicative payouts, payment is settled immediately via UPI or cash, and a digital collection receipt is generated.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Safe Handling</span>
              Secure bin containers prevent battery punctures or mercury bulb damage.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Instant Digital Receipt</span>
              Documenting custody transfer and responsible disposal commitment.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 4 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 font-black text-2xl border border-eco-200">
            04
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal-400 mt-3">Stage Four</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mt-1">Recycled Responsibly</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9 bg-charcoal-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-charcoal-100 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
            All gathered materials are transported to licensed Karnataka State Pollution Control Board (KSPCB) and CPCB-registered recycling facilities. Circuits, copper, aluminum, and precious metals are recovered, plastics are pelletized, and hazardous compounds are safely neutralized.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Zero Landfill Divergence</span>
              Nothing is dumped in lakes, open quarries, or informal burning yards.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Circular Economy</span>
              Raw metals re-enter manufacturing supply chains, reducing mining demand.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-charcoal-100 text-xs text-charcoal-600 sm:col-span-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal-900 block mb-1">✓ Material Dismantling, Never Resold</span>
              ebin does not repair or resell gadgets to consumers. Every device is dismantled to reclaim raw commodities, guaranteeing permanent physical data destruction.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pre-Pickup Data Safety Guide -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-50 border-t border-charcoal-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm border border-charcoal-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-eco-600 mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900">Your Data Security Checklist</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-600 mb-6">
          Before handing over smartphones, computers, or tablets, we recommend completing these simple steps:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">1</span>
            <span><strong>Cloud Backup:</strong> Back up your photos, contacts, and WhatsApp chats to Google Drive or iCloud.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">2</span>
            <span><strong>Sign Out:</strong> Remove your Google, Apple ID, Samsung, or Microsoft accounts from the device settings.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">3</span>
            <span><strong>Factory Reset:</strong> Perform a full factory reset (Erase all content and settings).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-eco-100 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">4</span>
            <span><strong>Remove SIMs & SD Cards:</strong> Pop out the physical SIM tray and micro-SD memory cards.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-400 mt-6 italic">
          * For devices that no longer turn on or have dead motherboards, our certified partner dismantlers physically shred and degauss magnetic drives to ensure unrecoverable destruction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">Ready to clear your e-waste?</h2>
      <p class="text-charcoal-300 text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Book your Bengaluru doorstep collection today and experience responsible recycling done right.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="/pickup/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-900 bg-eco-500 hover:bg-eco-400 transition-colors shadow-lg"
        >
          Schedule a Doorstep Pickup
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
